    <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
    <h1>Built by people still climbing.</h1>
    <p>Trenches Mentality is a community for anyone doing everything they can to make it out: with a laptop, a hoe, a camera, a microphone, or just stubborn discipline.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="two-col">
