      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Why this exists</h2>
      <p>Most success stories online start at the finish line. Nobody shows the first ugly attempt, the money that was lost, the farm season that failed, the app nobody downloaded.</p>
      <p>This place is the opposite. We write from the middle of it. We share the numbers, the tools, the mistakes and the small wins, so the next person doesn't have to learn everything the hard way.</p>
      <p>It doesn't matter if your way out is code, AI, agriculture, art or a small business. If it's honest work and you're serious about it, you belong here.</p>
